Carafe: d3d9.frontEndThread, the switch for the Direct3D 9 front end on its own thread in Carafe's DXVK build, is
one more key the runtime copies from the program settings into dxvk.conf.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

--- a/horizon-wine/source/dxvk_options.c
+++ b/horizon-wine/source/dxvk_options.c
@@ -431,6 +431,9 @@
     OPTION( "d3d9.unchangedStateFastPath",
             "Carafe's DXVK build: a state set to the value it already has returns before the device lock.",
             boolean, 30101, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, "True" ),
+    OPTION( "d3d9.frontEndThread",
+            "Carafe's DXVK build: the Direct3D 9 front end runs on a thread of its own.",
+            boolean, 30101, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, "False" ),
 };
 #undef OPTION
 
